Z||000010||penetrator||10-31-1999||11:39 AM||||Thanks for all replays and jokes =)<BR>But "Theogre" said something i reacted over, i just changed my clutch disc and stuff, and after we reassambled the car and i started it up, the car was pulling all the gears. Then we dicovered the pin on the clutchpedal was really worn, we fixed it with a little metal pipe to build up the worn part. And if the idle is going down to 1000rpm when its hot, that can explain wy its not stalling when its cold, when the idle is around 1500rpm. Im going to check that pin again, and im open for proposal how to fix it.<P>tKnxhthks<BR>Magnus from Swedn =)||||reg||10
